sequenceDiagram
    actor Admin
    participant Proposer as Jira consumer
    participant Cassini
    participant Controller as Git controller
    participant Observer as Git observer
    participant Processor as Scheduler processor
    participant Graph as Neo4j
    participant Creds as Credentials agent

    Note over Admin,Controller: Admission rules first: a signed runtime document, section admission
    Admin->>Processor: signed runtime document for the controller
    Processor-)Cassini: document on the controller's configuration topic
    Cassini-)Controller: document
    Controller->>Controller: verify for itself, until then accept nothing

    Note over Proposer,Graph: A proposal
    Proposer-)Cassini: Proposal kind, subject, evidence
    Cassini-)Processor: Proposal, publisher named by the broker
    Processor->>Graph: write a Proposal node
    Cassini-)Controller: Proposal, publisher named by the broker
    Controller->>Controller: normalise, then apply the rules in order
    alt rejected
        Controller-)Cassini: ProposalDecision rejected and the rule
    else pending
        Controller-)Cassini: ProposalDecision pending and what for
    else accepted
        Controller-)Cassini: ProposalDecision accepted
        Controller-)Observer: repository to observe, naming its credential
        Observer->>Creds: RetrieveSecret for that credential, if it does not hold it
        Creds-->>Observer: re-encrypted to the agent's own escrow key
        Observer->>Observer: host binding and network guard, then clone
    end
    Cassini-)Processor: ProposalDecision
    Processor->>Graph: write a decision node, linked to the proposal

    Note over Admin,Observer: Approval and credentials are signed edits
    Admin->>Processor: a new admission section (an approval), or a credentials document for the observer
    Processor-)Cassini: document
    Cassini-)Controller: admission section, re-evaluate every pending proposal
    Cassini-)Observer: credentials section, decrypt and escrow with StoreSecret

    Note over Processor,Controller: A restarted controller gets them again
    Processor-)Cassini: replay the documents and the kind's proposals
    Cassini-)Controller: documents, then proposals
    Controller->>Controller: re-evaluate against the current rules
